1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,161
Krakatau kini punya cucu.

2
00:00:02,161 --> 00:00:02,898
Dulu,

3
00:00:02,898 --> 00:00:06,921
letusan dahsyat Krakatau
melenyapkan sebagian besar pulaunya.

4
00:00:06,921 --> 00:00:08,004
Dari dasar laut,

5
00:00:08,004 --> 00:00:09,538
lahirlah Anak Krakatau.

6
00:00:09,538 --> 00:00:10,672
September lalu,

7
00:00:10,672 --> 00:00:13,303
ia erupsi 25 jam nonstop,

8
00:00:13,303 --> 00:00:15,740
abunya sampai menutup
Bandara Soekarno-Hatta.

9
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:16,049
Lalu,

10
00:00:16,049 --> 00:00:17,577
muncul dua daratan baru.

11
00:00:17,577 --> 00:00:18,956
Kalau erupsi berlanjut,

12
00:00:18,956 --> 00:00:20,570
daratannya bisa makin luas.

13
00:00:20,570 --> 00:00:21,373
Kalau berhenti,

14
00:00:21,373 --> 00:00:22,716
ombak bisa menghapusnya.

15
00:00:22,716 --> 00:00:24,988
Anak Krakatau pun pernah timbul tenggelam,

16
00:00:24,988 --> 00:00:26,766
sebelum akhirnya bertahan.

17
00:00:26,766 --> 00:00:27,520
Menurutmu,

18
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:29,242
cucu Krakatau bakal bertahan?

19
00:00:29,242 --> 00:00:31,268
Tulis di komentar.
